  "term": "HOME",
  "definition": "Home is more than a physical dwelling; in psychology and social life it is a meaning-filled space linked to safety, privacy, belonging, identity, memories, relationships, and everyday routines. It becomes a psychological shelter as people invest a place with personal and social significance.",
